{"baseTypeIndex":5,"blankCount":1,"difficulty":5,"exerciseID":"0DrOHrm2appzGzxCguO","exerciseType":"writeout","gradeIndex":8,"gradeLevel":"","gradeName":"八年级","optCount":4,"queAns":"(1)(2,2)(2)2＜x＜6(3) $\\left(\\frac83,0\\right)$ ","queCtlgs":[{"catalogId":"5eccb62f518ec3c65e1e9186","queId":"0DrOHrm2appzGzxCguO","schCode":"3019","textbookId":"5eccb58b518ec3c65e1e917b"}],"question":"如图所示，在平面直角坐标系中，直线y<sub>1</sub>=2x-2和直线 $y_2=-\\frac12x+3$ 分别交x轴于A,B两点，两条直线相交于点C.<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/187c3058a750335.png\">(1)求点C坐标;(2)若y<sub>1</sub>>y<sub>2</sub>>0，求x的取值范围;(3)若CP平分∠ACB交x轴于点P,请求出点P坐标.","solution":"(1)<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/187c30664ed032m.png\">解得<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/187c306995d034u.png\">所以点C坐标为（2，2）；(2)令y<sub>2</sub>=0,解得x=6,即B(6,0),因为<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/187c3070a92032q.png\">所以2<x<6;(3)过点P作线段PE⊥CP，过点C、E分别作x轴的垂线交于点F、G，P（a，0），由题意，可得 A（1，0），B（6，0），C（2，2），F（2，0），<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/187c307835b034w.png\"><img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/187c3079b62033c.png\"><img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/187c307b5cb032r.png\">∴∠ACB＝90°，又∵CP是角平分线，∴∠PCB＝45°，∴△CPE为等腰直角三角形，∴CP＝PE，∠CPF＋∠EPG＝90°，又∵∠CPF＋∠PCF＝90°，∴∠EPG＝∠PCF，∴△CFP≌△PGE（AAS），∴PG＝CF＝2，EG＝PF＝a－2，∵点E（a＋2，a－2）在y<sub>2</sub>上，<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/187c3085767033g.png\">解得<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/187c30885d5032u.png\">则<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/187c308aa480350.png\"><img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2023/187c308ce1f033i.png\">","subQueNum":0,"subQues":[],"subjectCategory":"math","tags":[{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":1,"knowId":"5eb921d3eb1662340148413d","knowName":"点与一次函数的图象的关系应用","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df23","knowTypeName":"题型","lastExamPointFlag":0,"priority":2,"queId":"0DrOHrm2appzGzxCguO","sortIndex":413},{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":1,"knowId":"5ece23aa2abd365ea81e8824","knowName":"一次函数图象与全等三角形的综合问题","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df23","knowTypeName":"题型","lastExamPointFlag":0,"priority":2,"queId":"0DrOHrm2appzGzxCguO","sortIndex":426},{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":1,"knowId":"5eb92234eb16623401484144","knowName":"一次函数与一元一次不等式的关系的应用","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df23","knowTypeName":"题型","lastExamPointFlag":1,"priority":2,"queId":"0DrOHrm2appzGzxCguO","sortIndex":443}]}